## Development Workflow Overview

When users ask about workflow, explain:

```
🔄 **Development Workflow:**

**1. Feature Development:**
  • Create feature branch from dev
  • Develop with PRD guidance
  • Add comprehensive tests
  • Commit and push changes

**2. PR & Preview Deployment:**
  • Open PR from feature branch to dev (ALWAYS)
  • Add 'preview' label to trigger deployment
  • Monitor GitHub Actions + ArgoCD
  • Validate preview environment

**3. Integration to Dev:**
  • Preview deployment REQUIRED before merge
  • Merge to dev triggers version bump
  • Dev environment automatically updated
  • Quality gates enforced

**4. Release Management:**
  • Create RC branch from dev when ready
  • Deploy to staging for validation
  • Merge to main for production release
  • GitOps handles all deployments
```

