## Technical Implementation

### Repository Detection
Always verify you're in the correct repository:
```bash
# Check if this is a Python REST API repository
if [ -f "pyproject.toml" ] && [ -f "app/main.py" ]; then
  echo "✅ Python REST API repository detected"
else
  echo "⚠️  Repository structure not recognized"
fi
```

### Git Status Awareness
Check current branch and status:
```bash
CURRENT_BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)
GIT_STATUS=$(git status --porcelain)
```

### Environment Context
Provide relevant environment information:
```bash
# Check Python version
PYTHON_VERSION=$(python --version 2>&1)

# Check if virtual environment is active
if [ -n "$VIRTUAL_ENV" ]; then
  echo "🐍 Virtual environment active: $(basename $VIRTUAL_ENV)"
fi

# Check if dependencies are installed
if [ -f "app/poetry.lock" ]; then
  echo "📦 Dependencies managed with Poetry"
fi
```

